pe : 003 - 자사몰 상품코드 기준 -> 쇼핑몰 상품 일괄전송 - 1:N -> 샵링커 원상품 수정</font> </li>\r\n       </ul>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\">Request Paramatter</h3>\r\n        <table class=\"board-col2\">\r\n        <colgroup>\r\n        <col width=\"5%\">\r\n        <col width=\"18%\">\r\n        <col width=\"10%\">\r\n        <col width=\"15%\">\r\n        <col width=\"25%\">\r\n        <col width=\"*\">\r\n        </colgroup>\r\n        <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th class=\"txt_c\" scope=\"col\">No.</th>\r\n            <th scope=\"col\">파라미터</th>\r\n            <th class=\"txt_c\" scope=\"col\">타입</th>\r\n            <th scope=\"col\">설명</th>\r\n            <th scope=\"col\">값의 범위</th>\r\n            <th scope=\"col\">비고</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        </thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">1.</td>\r\n            <td><span class=\"ico ico-css\">필수</span> customer_id</td>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\r\n            <td>고객사코드(샵링커 가입코드)</td>\r\n            <td>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n            <td>샵링커에서 발급받은 코드<br> ex) a0000001</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">2.</td>\r\n            <td> mall_product_id</td>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\r\n            <td>쇼핑몰상품코드</td>\r\n            <td></td>\r\n            <td>type값이 001일 경우 <span class=\"ico ico-css\">필수</span> 입력입니다.</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">3.</td>\r\n            <td> mall_id</td>\r\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\r\n            <td>샵링커 쇼핑몰 코드</td>\r\n            <td><input type=\"button\" style='cursor:hand' value='샵링커 쇼핑몰 코드 리스트' onclick=\"javascript:window.open('/ShoplinkerApi/Docs2/pop/mall_list.html?customer_id', 'mall_cate', 'width=500,height=200,scrollbars=yes')\"></td>\r\n            <td>type값이 001일 경우 <span clas